## Verdict

- Novel peptides (1% class FDR): model **461** vs null **374** across 12 populations.
- PC-churn: canonical PSMs 9,961,958 (baseline) -> 9,804,842 (model, -157,116) -> 8,481,926 (null, -1,480,032). The null DB displaces 1,322,916 MORE canonical PSMs than the model DB.
- Net PSM: model 9,988,858 vs null 10,074,790.

